gned}2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]+{x}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}-4 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ k\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}-4{x}_{2}=0 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-5{x}_{2}=1 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-4{x}_{2}=k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo solve the system above, we set up and row reduce an augmented matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & [\\begin{aligned}2 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -4 & k\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{2}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -5 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -4 & k\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}-3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -4 & k\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}-2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & k\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe third row of the augmented matrix now corresponds to the equation $0{x}_{1}+0{x}_{2}=k.$ Therefore, the system has a solution only if\n\n$$\nk=0.\n$$" 13194139535415 true] [17592186348072 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348073 13194139535415 true] [17592186348072 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348074 13194139535415 true] [17592186348072 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348075 13194139535415 true] [17592186348072 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348076 13194139535415 true] [17592186348072 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348077 13194139535415 true] [17592186348072 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535415 true] [17592186348072 1041 "selection" 13194139535415 true] [17592186348072 1104 #edb/ref 17592186348077 13194139535415 true] [17592186348072 1110 #uuid "0a7a6eaf-37f1-5d02-8771-868c922d65ee" 13194139535415 true] [17592186348073 1034 "12" 13194139535415 true] [17592186348073 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535415 true] [17592186348073 1111 #uuid "ae44989b-7bf8-5c3e-bcb2-7a44520d1ff3" 13194139535415 true] [17592186348074 1034 "-9" 13194139535415 true] [17592186348074 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535415 true] [17592186348074 1111 #uuid "a908ed17-5d